\"PMA-HD\", ...38 models],\n  \"description\": \"Self-indicating, single-interval, non-automatic weighing instruments designed for paint mixing applications. Family comprises PMA-EV (Class II, 28 models) and PMA-HD (Class III, 10 models). Plastic construction, stainless steel load receptor, plastic display head; 3 feet (2 adjustable) with level indicator; LCD segment display with fixed position touch keys (EVO1*, LAB1*, SPO1*) or LCD graphic display with touch function (VIS1*); EX-link converter for voltage supply and data transfer on Ex models (EVO1X*, LAB1X*, VIS1X*, VIS1Y*). Fitted with one strain gauge load cell (Bizerba WS8 or WS3). Not to be used for direct sales to the public. A PC with compatible paint mixing software can be connected via provided interfaces.\",\n  ...\n}\n```\n\nDevices & interfaces: include in description:\n\"Devices: initial zero-setting device (≤ 20% of Max), zero-tracking device (≤ 4% of Max), zero indicator (LAB1*, SPO1*), combined zero-setting and tare-balancing device, preset tare device (only via PC), approximate displaying device (EVO1*, VIS1*), weight accumulation, weight calculating. Interfaces: USB (direct on SPO1S*, EVO1S*, EVO1Y*; via Ex-link converter on EVO1X*, LAB1X*); Ethernet via Ex-link converter (VIS1X*, VIS1Y*).\"\n\nSealing: two tamper-evident labels underside; menu access switch covered by tamper-evident label. Include in description? Maybe brief.\n\nmodule_designation: For R76 certs, \"Automatic weighing instrument modules\"? Not applicable. Omit.\n\nNow components:\n\n```json\n[\n  {\n    \"role\": \"load_cell\",\n    \"type_designations\": [\"Bizerba WS8\"],\n    \"alternatives\": null,\n    \"characteristics\": {\n      \"maximum_capacity\": {\"value\": 8, \"unit_symbol\": \"kg\", \"unit_id\": null},\n      \"used_in\": {\"value\": \"PMA-EV (Class II) models\"}\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    \"role\": \"load_cell\",\n    \"type_designations\": [\"Bizerba WS3\"],\n    \"alternatives\": null,\n    \"characteristics\": {\n 