      "type": "text",
      "text": "{\n  \"certificate\": {\n    \"number\": \"R76/2006-A-GB1-18.07\",\n    \"scheme\": \"A\",\n    \"project_number\": \"P02276\",\n    \"page_total\": 5,\n    \"member_state\": \"United Kingdom of Great Britain and Northern Ireland\",\n    \"date_issued\": \"2018-05-11\"\n  },\n  \"issuing_authority\": {\n    \"name\": \"NMO\",\n    \"address_lines\": [\"Stanton Avenue\", \"Teddington\", \"TW11 0JZ\", \"United Kingdom\"],\n    \"person_responsible\": \"Mannie Panesar\",\n    \"person_title\": \"Head of Technical Services\",\n    \"phone\": \"+44 (0) 20 8943 7272\",\n    \"website\": \"www.gov.uk/government/organisations/office-for-product-safety-and-standards\"\n  },\n  \"applicants\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Sartorius Lab Instruments GmbH & Co KG\",\n      \"address_lines\": [\"37070 Goettingen\", \"Germany\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"manufacturers\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Sartorius Lab Instruments GmbH & Co KG\",\n      \"address_lines\": [\"37070 Goettingen\", \"Germany\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"certified_type\": {\n    \"category\": \"Non-automatic weighing instrument\",\n    \"type_designations\": [\n      \"PMA-EV\", \"PMA-HD\",\n      \"EVO1S1N3CI-C\", \"EVO1S1CI-C\", \"EVO1Y1N3CI-C\", \"EVO1Y1CI-C\",\n      \"EVO1X1N3CI-C\", \"EVO1X1CI-C\", \"EVO1X2N3CI-C\", \"EVO1X2CI-C\",\n      \"EVO1X3N3CI-C\", \"EVO1X3CI-C\", \"EVO1X4N3CI-C\", \"EVO1X4CI-C\",\n      \"VIS1Y1M3CI-C\", \"VIS1Y1CI-C\", \"VIS1Y2M3CI-C\", \"VIS1Y2CI-C\",\n      \"VIS1Y3M3CI-C\", \"VIS1Y3CI-C\", \"VIS1Y4M3CI-C\", \"VIS1Y4CI-C\",\n      \"VIS1X1M3CI-C\", \"VIS1X1CI-C\", \"VIS1X2M3CI-C\", \"VIS1X2CI-C\",\n      \"VIS1X3M3CI-C\", \"VIS1X3CI-C\", \"VIS1X4M3CI-C\", \"VIS1X4CI-C\",\n      \"SPO1S1N3CI-C\", \"SPO1S1CI-C\",\n      \"LAB1X1N3CI-C\", \"LAB1X1CI-C\", \"LAB1X2N3CI-C\", \"LAB1X2CI-C\",\n      \"LAB1X3N3CI-C\", \"LAB1X3CI-C\", \"LAB1X4N3CI-C\", \"LAB1X4CI-C\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Self-indicating, single-interval, non-automatic weighing instruments designed to be used in paint mixing applications. The instrument shall not be used for direct sales to the public. The family comprises the PMA-EV (Class II) and PMA-HD (Class III) types. Model name composition: A = S, X or Y denoting operation in standard environments, Ex-zone 1 or Ex-zone 2 explosive environments respectively; B = 1, 2, 3 or 4 denoting supplied RJ-45 cable lengths of no cable, 10 m, 20 m or 30 m respectively (B = 1 for A = S and EVO1Y models); C is a placeholder for commercial name affixes. Construction: plastic construction, stainless steel load receptor, plastic display head, 3 feet (2 adjustable), level indicator. Display: LCD segment display with fixed position touch keys (models EVO1*, LAB1*, SPO1*) or LCD graphic display with touch function (models VIS1*). EX-link converter for voltage supply and data transfer (models EVO1X*, LAB1X*, VIS1X*, VIS1Y*). Devices: initial zero setting device (<= 20% of Max), zero tracking device (<= 4% of Max), zero indicator (models LAB1*, SPO1*), combined zero-setting and tare-balancing device, preset tare device (only via a PC), approximate displaying device (models EVO1*, VIS1*), weight accumulation, weight calculating. Interfaces: USB either directly (models SPO1S*, EVO1S*, EVO1Y*) or via Ex-link converter (models EVO1X*, LAB1X*); Ethernet via Ex-link converter (models VIS1X*, VIS1Y*). A PC with compatible paint mixing software can be connected to the instruments by the interfaces provided; all devices can be initiated via a PC, preset-tare can only be introduced via a PC. The instrument is fitted with one strain gauge load cell manufactured by Bizerba. Power supply 5 V DC provided by USB; for models LAB1X*, EVO1X*, VIS1X*, VIS1Y* power is delivered from USB to the Ex-link converter and then to the instrument via RJ-45. Sealing: access to the electronics and load cell is prevented by two tamper evident labels on the underside of the instrument; access to the menu access switch is prevented by a tamper evident label covering the switch.\"\n  },\n  \"model_family\": {\n    \"family_name\": null,\n    \"models\": [\n      {\"model_id\": \"EVO1S1N3CI-C\", \"label\": \"PMA-EV\", \"attributes\": {\"instrument_type\": \"PMA-EV\", \"accuracy_class\": \"II\", \"environment\": \"standard\", \"rj45_cable_length\": {\"value\": \"none\"}}},\n      {\"model_id\": \"EVO1S1CI-C\", \"label\": \"PMA-EV\", \"attributes\": {\"instrument_type\": \"PMA-EV\", \"accuracy_class\": \"II\", \"environment\": \"standard\", \"rj45_cable_length\": {\"value\": \"none\"}}},\n      {\"model_id\": \"EVO1Y1N3CI-C\", \"label\": \"PMA-EV\", \"attributes\": {\"instrument_type\": \"PMA-EV\", \"accuracy_class\": \"II\", \"environment\": \"Ex-zone 2\", \"rj45_cable_length\": {\"value\": \"none\"}}},\n      {\"model_id\": \"EVO1Y1CI-C\", \"label\": \"PMA-EV\", \"attributes\": {\"instrument_type\": \"PMA-EV\", \"accuracy_class\": \"II\", \"environment\": \"Ex-zone 2\", \"rj45_cable_length\": {\"value\": \"none\"}}},\n      {\"model_id\": \"EVO1X1N3CI-C\", \"label\": \"PMA-EV\", \"attributes\": {\"instrument_type\": \"PMA-EV\", \"accuracy_class\": \"II\", \"environment\": \"Ex-zone 1\", \"rj45_cable_length\": {\"value\": \"none\"}}},\n      {\"model_id\": \"EVO1X1CI-C\", \"label\": \"PMA-EV\", \"attributes\": {\"instrument_type\": \"PMA-EV\", \"accuracy_class\": \"II\", \"environment\": \"Ex-zone 1\", \"rj45_cable_length\": {\"value\": \"none\"}}},\n      {\"model_id\": \"EVO1X2N3CI-C\", \"label\": \"PMA-EV\", \"attributes\": {\"instrument_type\": \"PMA-EV\", \"accuracy_class\": \"II\", \"environment\": \"Ex-zone 1\", \"rj45_cable_length\": {\"value\": 10, \"unit_symbol\": \"m\"}}},\n      {\"model_id\": \"EVO1X2CI-C\", \"label\": \"PMA-EV\", \"attributes\": {\"instrument_type\": \"PMA-EV\", \"accuracy_class\": \"II\", \"environment\": \"Ex-zone 1\", \"rj45_cable_length\": {\"value\": 10, \"unit_symbol\": \"m\"}}},\n      {\"model_id\": \"EVO1X3N3CI-C\", \"label\": \"PMA-EV\", \"attributes\": {\"instrument_type\": \"PMA-EV\", \"accuracy_class\": \"II\", \"environment\": \"Ex-zone 1\", \"rj45_cable_length\": {\"value\": 20, \"unit_symbol\": \"m\"}}},\n      {\"model_id\": \"EVO1X3CI-C\", \"label\": \"PMA-EV\", \"attributes\": {\"instrument_type\": \"PMA-EV\", \"accuracy_class\": \"II\", \"environment\": \"Ex-zone 1\", \"rj45_cable_length\": {\"value\": 20, \"unit_symbol\": \"m\"}}},\n      {\"model_id\": \"EVO1X4N3CI-C\", \"label\": \"PMA-EV\", \"attributes\": {\"instrument_type\": \"PMA-EV\", \"accuracy_class\": \"II\", \"environment\": \"Ex-zone 1\", \"rj45_cable_length\": {\"value\": 30, \"unit_symbol\": \"m\"}}},\n      {\"model_id\": \"EVO1X4CI-C\", \"label\": \"PMA-EV\", \"attributes\": {\"instrument_type\": \"PMA-EV\", \"accuracy_class\": \"II\", \"environment\": \"Ex-zone 1\", \"rj45_cable_length\": {\"value\": 30, \"unit_symbol\": \"m\"}}},\n      {\"model_id\": \"VIS1Y1M3CI-C\", \"label\": \"PMA-EV\", \"attributes\": {\"instrument_type\": \"PMA-EV\", \"accuracy_class\": \"II\", \"environment\": \"Ex-zone 2\", \"rj45_cable_length\": {\"value\": \"none\"}}},\n      {\"model_id\": \"VIS1Y1CI-C\", \"label\": \"PMA-EV\", \"attributes\": {\"instrument_type\": \"PMA-EV\", \"accuracy_class\": \"II\", \"environment\": \"Ex-zone 2\", \"rj45_cable_length\": {\"value\": \"none\"}}},\n      {\"model_id\": \"VIS1Y2M3CI-C\", \"label\": \"PMA-EV\", \"attributes\": {\"instrument_type\": \"PMA-EV\", \"accuracy_class\": \"II\", \"environment\": \"Ex-zone 2\", \"rj45_cable_length\": {\"value\": 10, \"unit_symbol\": \"m\"}}},\n      {\"model_id\": \"VIS1Y2CI-C\", \"label\": \"PMA-EV\", \"attributes\": {\"instrument_type\": \"PMA-EV\", \"accuracy_class\": \"II\", \"environment\": \"Ex-zone 2\", \"rj45_cable_length\": {\"value\": 10, \"unit_symbol\": \"m\"}}},\n      {\"model_id\": \"VIS1Y3M3CI-C\", \"label\": \"PMA-EV\", \"attributes\": {\"instrument_type\": \"PMA-EV\", \"accuracy_class\": \"II\", \"environment\": \"Ex-zone 2\", \"rj45_cable_length\": {\"value\": 20, \"unit_symbol\": \"m\"}}},\n      {\"mo